-guldlagen-10\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-öster-guldlagen_10-0\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20170905055959/http://ostersif.se/guldlagen\">”Guldlagen”</a>.&#32;<i><span>ostersif.se</span></i>. Arkiverad från <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://ostersif.se/guldlagen\">originalet</a>&#32;den 5 september 2017<span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20170905055959/http://ostersif.se/guldlagen\">https://web.archive.org/web/20170905055959/http://ostersif.se/guldlagen</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 5 september 2017</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.btitle=Guldlagen&amp;rft.atitle=ostersif.se&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fweb.archive.org%2Fweb%2F20170905055959%2Fhttp%3A%2F%2Fostersif.se%2Fguldlagen&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Fotbollsallsvenskan&#95;1968\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-11\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-11\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.fotbollsweden.se/Allsve%201968.htm\">”Allsvenskan i Fotboll 1968”</a>. fotbollsweden.se<span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.fotbollsweden.se/Allsve%201968.htm\">http://www.fotbollsweden.se/Allsve%201968.htm</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 23 april 2021</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#9